CYGM is an open-source experimental secondary CGM display. It is not
FDA-cleared or FDA-approved and has not been clinically validated. Do not use
it as the sole basis for a treatment decision, or as a replacement for your
prescribed CGM receiver or app and its alerts. Always confirm glucose
information on your official CGM system before dosing or treating.
